213Z","evidenceHash":"41508c82aa2bde222cdb295f1d7db87212a7c770fd62b23b8d3ac4cb6de426e7"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-03-28","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-28T08:49:34.213Z","evidenceHash":"41508c82aa2bde222cdb295f1d7db87212a7c770fd62b23b8d3ac4cb6de426e7"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SKY.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SKY.png","website":"https://www.championhomes.com","ceo":"Timothy Mark Larson","full_time_employees":"9300","description":"Champion Homes, Inc. manufactures and sells prefabricated housing units throughout North America. Its diverse product portfolio includes manufactured and modular homes, recreational park model vehicles, accessory dwelling units, and specialized modular structures catering to the multi-family and hospitality sectors. The company operates under numerous brand names across the United States, including Skyline Homes, Champion Home Builders, Genesis Homes, Athens Park Models, Dutch Housing, Atlantic Homes, Excel Homes, Homes of Merit, New Era, Redman Homes, ScotBilt Homes, Shore Park, Silvercrest, and Titan Homes. In western Canada, its products are sold under the Moduline and SRI Homes labels. Beyond manufacturing, Champion Homes offers construction services for the installation and setup of its factory-built residences. It also manages Titan Factory Direct, a direct-to-consumer retail business with 18 sales centers strategically located across the southern United States, and provides transportation services for both manufactured homes and recreational vehicles. The company was established in 2010 and is headquartered in Troy, Michigan.","description_en":"Champion Homes, Inc. manufactures and sells prefabricated housing units throughout North America. Its diverse product portfolio includes manufactured and modular homes, recreational park model vehicles, accessory dwelling units, and specialized modular structures catering to the multi-family and hospitality sectors. The company operates under numerous brand names across the United States, including Skyline Homes, Champion Home Builders, Genesis Homes, Athens Park Models, Dutch Housing, Atlantic Homes, Excel Homes, Homes of Merit, New Era, Redman Homes, ScotBilt Homes, Shore Park, Silvercrest, and Titan Homes. In western Canada, its products are sold under the Moduline and SRI Homes labels. Beyond manufacturing, Champion Homes offers construction services for the installation and setup of its factory-built residences. It also manages Titan Factory Direct, a direct-to-consumer retail business with 18 sales centers strategically located across the southern United States, and provides transportation services for both manufactured homes and recreational vehicles. The company was established in 2010 and is headquartered in Troy, Michigan.","description_zh":"Champion Homes, Inc.（美股代碼：SKY）為 Consumer Cyclical 領域之重要企業，專注於 Residential Construction 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"755 West Big Beaver Road","city":"Troy","state":"MI","zip":"48084","country":"US","phone":"248 614 8211","full_address":"755 West Big Beaver Road, Troy, MI 48084, US","range_52w":"63.87-99.5","year_high":99.5,"year_low":63.87,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":63.87,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-08-27","name":"Haack Michael","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":1645,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-27","name":"Haack Michael","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-17","name":"LYALL JONATHAN WADE","title":"officer: EVP Sales/Business Development","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":1804,"price":94.53,"total_val":0.17},{"date":"2026-08-17","name":"Krueger Laurel","title":"officer: CLO & Secretary","